        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Raguang nang Bumaeng Than rui zailou o,",
            "Kandih rianrapui ram khou hei;",
            "Thuak lou mei nun rui lungni pui kai khou,",
            "Nang mei nun ta zailou.",
            "",
            "Zailou o tingkauh kai khou,",
            "Zingh pui ram hei patlou na;",
            "Zauzih mei guai ta ngam louna,",
            "Ai lungni tingkauh ram khou.",
            "",
            "2. Poubaomei Bumaeng akhou bam pukhou,",
            "Alungh rianramei nai lak khe;",
            "Rianra lakmei kandi hei tuan pukhou,",
            "Nang ramgai khou ai lungni.",
            "",
            "3. Poubaomei nang Bumaeng akhou rui zailou o,",
            "Nang kandih banthai puiram khou;",
            "Ata patlou rio nangram tang maksaan,",
            "Himdaihmei aPoubaomei.",
            "",
            "4. Nang rui rianra mei kaguai akhaeng na,",
            "Ravguangc khalou o tuna sa;",
            "Theihmei ngan nang Bumaeng rui zailou o,",
            "Nang kandih ai tangdiu khang."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
